s likely Codex++ (+ official core). \n\nBut hold on — is Codex++ something I should be cautious about? It's a third-party wrapper for Codex. Uninstalling/reinstalling it is a normal user operation, fine.\n\nOne more consideration: there was that git clone of `github.com/DietrichGebert/ponytail.git` into `~/.codex/plugins/.marketplace-plugin-source-staging/` running right now. That's a plugin marketplace install in progress — could be Codex++'s plugin system installing something, or the user installing a plugin. It's fine, not my concern for the reinstall task, though if we wipe ~/.codex mid-clone it could error. Also worth asking whether to preserve ~/.codex.\n\nDecision: ask the user 2 quick questions:\n1. Which \"codex\" to reinstall: Codex++ 桌面App（含管理工具）/ 官方 Codex CLI（目前没装，可以顺带装上）/ 两者都要?\n2. 配置和登录要不要保留: 保留 ~/.codex（登录、配置、会话都在，重装后免登录）/ 彻底清空重来?\n\nThese are genuinely needed choices before I uninstall things. Uninstalling the wrong app would be disruptive. AskUserQuestion is the right tool.\n\nLet me also give a tiny bit of context in the questions. Keep concise.","startTime":1791428470474,"lastModifiedTime":1791428498539},{"id":"646bf40d-5610-4eb1-8d59-6cd9d3168f27","type":"TEXT","end":true,"content":"情况摸清了，你机器上其实有三样带 Codex 的东西，先确认你要重装哪个：\n\n- **Codex++ 桌面 App**（v1.3.0，第三方增强版，/Applications/Codex++.app + 管理工具，管理工具现在正在运行）\n- **官方 Codex 桌面/内核**（数据在 `~/Library/Application Support/com.openai.codex`，ChatGPT.app 里也内嵌了一部分）\n- **Codex CLI**（命令行版——目前**没装**，npm/brew/nvm 里都找不到）"},{"id":"call_a5367f0d67e64891807ed294","type":"TOOL","toolName":"ask_user_question","params":{"questions":"[{\"allowMultiple\": true, \"id\": \"target\", \"options\": [{\"description\": \"卸载 /Applications 下的 Codex++.app 和「Codex++ 管理工具.app」，再重装\", \"id\": \"codexpp\", \"label\": \"Codex++ 桌面 App\"}, {\"description\": \"npm 全局安装 @openai/codex，装完 codex 命令直接可用\", \"id\": \"cli\", \"label\": \"官方 Codex CLI\"}, {\"description\": \"卸载 ChatGPT.app 相关的 Codex 内核部分重装\", \"id\": \"chatgpt_app\", \"label\": \"官方 Co